        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2006, Traditional R-Series 24\" Double Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis R-Series Towel Bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known. The traditional styling of the mounts on Deltana's R2006 double towel bar makes it great for any traditional setting; and the 24 inch length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made out of solid brass, it is available in an array of beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2006-specifications.gif?v=1704354723\" width=\"600\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2006 24\" Double Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/traditional-24-inch-towel-bar-deltana-r2003\"><b>Deltana 24\" R-Series Single Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R Solid Brass Double 24\" Classic Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Bar Length: 24-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2006.pdf?v=1704262291\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2006 24\" Double Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
