                "description": "Deltana R2006 24 Inch Double Towel Bar - This R-Series Towel Bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known. The traditional styling of the mounts on Deltana's R2006 double towel bar makes it great for any traditional setting; and the 24 inch length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made out of solid brass, it is available in 7 beautiful finishes.",
